"""Authored evidence content for the Angola Critical-Minerals Investor Atlas.

Single source of truth for: sources, survey families, claims, candidates, data requests and
verification tests. build_content.py joins this with the spatial layers and writes
atlas/data/atlas.json plus the CSV/Markdown registers.

Evidence types (used everywhere):
  measured     – a laboratory or instrument result with a stated value (assay, drill intercept, survey grid)
  occurrence   – a catalogued / observed presence of a mineral or element, no grade or size
  operator     – a statement by a project holder (or relayed by government on its behalf): capacity, capex, dates, revenue
  interpretation – a geological inference (domains, provinces, 'probable' ratings, deposit hypotheses)
  coverage     – the extent / parameters of a survey, not a result
"""

